rovided immediately.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-12\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Within favorites view, search box filters favorited templates. Search \\\"profesh\\\" resulted in \\\"Showing 0 of 7 templates\\\" with empty state message. Filters (Category, Scenario, Sort By) remain accessible in favorites view. Search and filter work without reloading.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Copy to Clipboard button clicked successfully. Visual feedback provided: (1) Toast notification with \\\"Copied to clipboard! The generated content has been copied.\\\", (2) Button text changed to \\\"Copied!\\\" with [active] state. Content successfully copied (verified via button state change and notification).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-28\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After page reload: (1) Favorites count persisted showing \\\"Favorites 1\\\", (2) Custom template \\\"Project Kickoff Checklist\\\" still in library, (3) Professional Resume still in favorites when clicking Favorites button (showing 1 of 7). Data persists using browser storage (localStorage/sessionStorage).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Email field accepts invalid format without validation; preview generated despite invalid email format\", \"actual\": \"Entered \\\"invalid-email-format\\\" (no @ sign) in Email field. Preview tab enabled and generated successfully showing invalid email in output. No validation error or preview unavailability triggered.\", \"evidence\": \"Preview displays: \\\"| invalid-email-format |\\\" without any indication of format error. Application should reject invalid formats or disable preview.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempted to submit template with all required fields empty. Toast notification appeared: \\\"Missing required 