e distinct fields suggests validation is in place. Fields remain independently fillable in forms with their original labels.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typed \\\"resum\\\" (5 characters, >2) in search box. Real-time suggestion dropdown appeared showing \\\"Professional Resume\\\" as matching suggestion. Results filtered to 1 template immediately. Suggestion clickable for quick selection. Demonstrates real-time associative suggestions with fuzzy matching.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Tested multiple updates: (1) Search \\\"resum\\\" updated results to 1 template without reload, (2) Category filter changed from Resume to All Categories updated count from 1 to 6 without reload, (3) Scenario filter (Business) updated results without reload, (4) Sort By changed from Most Popular to Recently Updated - all without page refresh. Results and counts update immediately.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When Professional Resume opened with no fields filled: (1) Alert displayed with heading \\\"Required fields missing\\\", (2) List explicitly showed: \\\"Please fill in: Full Name, Job Title, Email, Professional Summary, Company Name, Position, Start Date, Responsibilities, Degree, School, Graduation Year, Skills\\\" (3) Preview Result tab disabled until fields filled. Clear UI feedback of missing fields.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-24\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Favoriting Professional Resume: (1) Heart button changed to [active] state immediately, (2) Favorites button updated from no badge to showing \\\"1\\\" count badge, (3) Clicking Favorites button showed favorites-only view with correct count. Unfavoriting reverses changes immediately. Immediate visual feedback for all favorite actions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\"